## Maven dependency API catalog

Public signatures for selected Maven dependencies live in `.kilocode/deps-api/` (generated).

- Search there before inventing Spring/library APIs.
- Regenerate after dependency changes: `scripts/generate-deps-api.sh`
- Config: `.kilocode/deps-api.config.yml`
- Agent rule: `.kilocode/rules/maven-deps-api.md`
- Do not put `.kilocode/deps-api/` in `.kilocodeignore`.
